===============================================================================
Word data / 词库数据
===============================================================================

The MIT licence above covers the code AND the demo word list in
data/demo-wordlist.csv, whose definitions, example sentences, translations and
root notes were written for this project.
上面的 MIT 协议同时覆盖代码和 data/demo-wordlist.csv 这份示例词表 —— 其中的
释义、例句、译文和词根注解都是为本项目原创编写的。

No other vocabulary content ships with this repository. Any word list you
import is governed by whatever licence that source carries; this project makes
no claim over it, and grants you no rights to it.
除此之外，本仓库不含任何词库内容。你导入的词表适用其来源本身的授权条款，本项
目对其不主张任何权利，也无法授予你任何权利。

Before publishing a fork that includes an imported word list, check that you
are entitled to redistribute it.
如果你要发布一个包含已导入词表的 fork，请先确认你有权重新分发那份数据。

