===============================================================================
Algorithm / 算法
===============================================================================

The scheduler implements SM-2 (Wozniak & Gorzelanczyk, 1994), which is
described in published literature and is not itself subject to copyright.
排程使用 SM-2 算法（Wozniak & Gorzelanczyk, 1994），该算法已在公开文献中发表，
算法本身不受版权保护。
